          "priest",
          "wanderer"
        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "留在营地照料孩子、伤者和牲畜的人衡量卡奥，比战歌更实际。他若只记得最响亮的战士，却忘记病马、寡妇与水囊，营火旁的敬畏便会一点点变成沉默。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
